    "2:ג": "(3) 20, 20, 25, 25, 25, 25, 25, 25, 25, 25, 25, 25, 25 Damiri Shagdo not in his kind, etc., but that the the Master trusted her words. And this seems to MA to be pressing. Even so, let them trust their words on Mimra Dela Ladutz and not Amimra Dakha. That's why the interpretation of MA, the words of the Toss, a model from Mimra Dahaka, the Toss Shafir Darba Sal of Bam Chutzas was accurate. His words are very interesting for those who tie the lolav to leave free the place of the hand grip, the HL to interpret for them if they are tying the lolov of a different kind, then they should leave it free. But in his kind, there is nothing in this, like a chaitza, but it is reasonable for Rabbi Dafi', in his kind, a buffer. And I ask a question to the MA of the Nal, let's go to the world. The association is a buffer between the hand and the handle because it is faded from BBM. But since Dahagad surrounds all three genders. Therefore, on the other side, the name of the willow and the myrtle, the name of the honeysuckle, which I bind to it, is a species that is not a species with the willow and the myrtle, and there will be a buffer between the myrtle and the willow, and the hand.",
    "3:_": "[Section 3] And this is also practiced even in the DM sand. And the Zal DM also practice even in the Haul Dela per the meaning of the words of the column l'fi da'at, which means precisely the BT Dassor to make a complete knot, one must tie as a 3 Akal Egged. Mm. Since the dalmitzvah in Egged is because of this to me and to him in the sand because it is possible to do as R. Yoda, that is, to make a complete connection because of this to me and to him. But the custom is not so. Since there is no connection between the 21st and the mitzvah because it is a sagi sagi in connection with everything that is a sagi:",
