    "5:_": "(Section 5) Jak against Ja. And the 16th wrote that we will tie Jak to Lulav, it will not be possible for him to quarrel at the time of moving. Therefore, the one who wants to go out by the hand of Mordechai, that is to do Jak. The legend will think that he will bind three species together into one bond. And he will make two knots in Lulav himself and it will be in conjunction with GK (and in his opinion it is possible if he makes two knots in the third species one above the other. It is enough for Lulav himself to have a connection) but in the book of AR it is divided. And it's enough if the upper part of the lolav has no connection with it, then the GK can dispute it.",
